    "terms.section3_body": "Jandosoft provides the service \"as is\". We do not guarantee that the service will be uninterrupted or error-free. In no event shall Jandosoft be liable for indirect damages, data loss, loss of revenue, or business interruption arising from the use or inability to use the platform. Our maximum liability is limited to the amount paid for the service in the last 12 months.",
    "terms.section4_title": "4. Data",
    "terms.section4_body": "Data stored on the platform is the property of the user. Jandosoft will not share personal information with third parties without explicit consent. The user is responsible for the accuracy of the data entered.",
    "terms.section5_title": "5. Subscriptions",
    "terms.section5_body": "Subscriptions renew automatically. The user may cancel at any time. No refunds are given for partial months. Jandosoft reserves the right to modify prices with 30 days prior notice.",
